<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2 style="color: #22c55e;">Multumim pentru mesajul tau!</h2>
  <p style="color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">
    Buna {{name}},
  </p>
  <p style="color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">
    Am primit mesajul tau si iti multumim pentru interesul acordat Asociatiei Green Space.
    Echipa noastra iti va raspunde in cel mai scurt timp posibil.
  </p>
  <div style="background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <h3 style="color: #374151; margin-top: 0;">Detaliile mesajului tau:</h3>
    <p><strong>Subiect:</strong> {{subject}}</p>
    <p><strong>Mesaj:</strong></p>
    <p style="color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">{{nl2br message}}</p>
  </div>
  <p style="color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">
    Cu respect,<br>
    <strong>Echipa Asociatia Green Space</strong>
  </p>
  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 30px 0;">
  <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">
    Email: contact@asociatiagreenspace.ro<br>
    Telefon: 0755 503 679<br>
    Adresa: Str. Vasile Alecsandri 31, Oltenita, Romania
  </p>
</div>
